<title>ESTONIA: Estonia's Savings Bank share issue oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Estonia's Savings Bank share issue oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's second largest bank, Savings Bank, said on Friday that its recent issue of 3.2 million new shares at the nominal value of ten kroons was heavily oversubscribed.</p>
<p>&quot;The issue amount was 3.2 million shares and the total number of subscribed shares was 121.2 million,&quot; the bank said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>The bank has assets worth 4.04 billion kroons and recorded a profit of 38.4 million kroons at the end of the third quarter 1996.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +3717-22 66 93</p>
</text>
